<section class="section-py" style="background:#fff">
  <div class="container-sm">
    <div class="text-center" style="margin-bottom:44px">
      <div class="kicker">FAQ</div>
      <h2 style="font-size:clamp(1.5rem,4vw,2.2rem);font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px">Instructor <span class="g-blue">Questions</span></h2>
      <p style="color:var(--slate);font-size:.88rem;max-width:380px;margin:0 auto">Everything you need to know before you apply.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:8px">
      <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q">Do I need prior teaching experience?<span class="faq-icon"><i class="fas fa-plus"></i></span></div><div class="faq-a">No prior teaching experience is required. We look for subject-matter expertise and a clear way of explaining concepts. Our onboarding team helps you develop your teaching style.</div></div>
      <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q">What equipment do I need to record?<span class="faq-icon"><i class="fas fa-plus"></i></span></div><div class="faq-a">A reasonably good laptop with a webcam and a quiet room is sufficient to start. We provide detailed guidelines on screen recording, audio, and lighting. A separate microphone is recommended but not mandatory.</div></div>
      <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q">How does the revenue share work?<span class="faq-icon"><i class="fas fa-plus"></i></span></div><div class="faq-a">You keep 70% of every paid enrollment. For example, if your course is priced at Kshs 3,500 and 100 students enrol in a month, you earn Kshs 245,000. Payouts are processed monthly via M-Pesa or bank transfer with no minimum required.</div></div>
      <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q">Can I set my own course price?<span class="faq-icon"><i class="fas fa-plus"></i></span></div><div class="faq-a">Yes — you set your own pricing within our suggested range (Kshs 500 – 15,000 for paid courses, or Free). You can update prices anytime, run promotions, or share coupon codes with your own audience.</div></div>
      <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q">How long does course review take?<span class="faq-icon"><i class="fas fa-plus"></i></span></div><div class="faq-a">Our quality team reviews new courses within 48 hours. We check video and audio quality, curriculum structure, and content accuracy. We send detailed feedback if changes are needed before publishing.</div></div>
      <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q">Can I teach multiple courses?<span class="faq-icon"><i class="fas fa-plus"></i></span></div><div class="faq-a">Absolutely — there's no limit on the number of courses you can publish. Many of our top instructors have 3–5 courses. Each additional course multiplies your earning potential significantly.</div></div>
      <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q">What happens after I submit my application?<span class="faq-icon"><i class="fas fa-plus"></i></span></div><div class="faq-a">Our Academy team reviews your application within 48 hours. If approved, we schedule a 20-minute onboarding call to get you set up. From there, most instructors publish their first course within 2 weeks.</div></div>
      <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q">Can I update my course after publishing?<span class="faq-icon"><i class="fas fa-plus"></i></span></div><div class="faq-a">Yes — you can add or update lessons at any time. Minor updates don't require re-review. Major structural changes go through a quick 24-hour review to maintain quality standards.</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

